<p>Hello,</p>

{% if meta['level'] == 'over' %}
<p>Your workspace <b>{{ meta['workspace'] }}</b> has used <b>{{ meta['used'] }}</b> AI replies this month ({{ meta['month'] }}), past the <b>{{ meta['allowance'] }}</b> included in your {{ meta['plan'] }} plan's fair use.</p>
{% else %}
<p>Your workspace <b>{{ meta['workspace'] }}</b> has used <b>{{ meta['used'] }}</b> of the <b>{{ meta['allowance'] }}</b> AI replies included in your {{ meta['plan'] }} plan this month ({{ meta['month'] }}).</p>
{% endif %}

<p>Nothing changes for your customers: the AI keeps answering, and nothing is charged automatically. If your volume stays at this level, we will get in touch about the plan that fits it.</p>

<p><a href="{{ action_url }}">See your usage</a></p>
